---
import {getPortfolio} from '../lib/content';
const {pieces}=await getPortfolio();
---
<section class="section cred" id="about"><div><div class="eyebrow">Jobs / work contexts</div><h2>Where some of the work happened.</h2><p>A job can contain many projects. A personal project can exist without one. These fictional roles demonstrate the distinction.</p></div><div class="credentials">{pieces.filter(p=>p.data.kind==='job').map(job=><div class="credential"><strong><a href={`/pieces/${job.id}/`}>{job.data.title}</a><br/><span>{job.data.role}</span></strong><span>{job.data.summary}</span></div>)}</div></section>
